            "csh_nailongjuexing": "捧腹",
            "csh_nailongjuexing_info": "当你受到<span style='color:#e74c3c'>伤害</span>后，你可以展示一张手牌，并令<span style='color:#e74c3c'>伤害</span>来源选择一项：<span style='color:#bd7ce0'>弃置</span>一张与此牌类型不同的手牌，或令你<span style='color:#34d17b'>回复</span>1点<span style='color:#eb7a33'>体力</span>。",
            "csh_daxiao": "大笑",
